{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Look from one eye to the other in a mirror. Why can't you normally catch the movement?",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.975,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.1",
      "samples": 119400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-2",
      "transcript": "Now record your eyes, and watch it back. There it is.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 5.3,
      "duration": 3.575,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.2",
      "samples": 85800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Each quick jump is a saccade.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 9.2,
      "duration": 2.35,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.3",
      "samples": 56400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-4",
      "transcript": "In the mirror, the eyes you're watching are also the eyes doing the looking.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 11.766666666666667,
      "duration": 4.5,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.4",
      "samples": 108000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-5",
      "transcript": "As they turn, the image sweeps across the retina.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 16.533333333333335,
      "duration": 3.55,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.5",
      "samples": 85200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Visual sensitivity drops around the movement. That's saccadic suppression.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 20.366666666666667,
      "duration": 4.95,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.6",
      "samples": 118800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-7",
      "transcript": "The clear views before and after can also mask the brief blur.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 25.6,
      "duration": 4.175,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.7",
      "samples": 100200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-8",
      "transcript": "You aren't completely blind. These effects help keep vision stable.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 30.066666666666666,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.8",
      "samples": 105600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-9",
      "transcript": "Watching a recording later separates the movement from your own eye turn.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 34.733333333333334,
      "duration": 4.65,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.9",
      "samples": 111600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-10",
      "transcript": "The mirror never stopped showing it. Your visual system normally keeps the sweep out of awareness.",
      "file": "audio/mirror-eyes/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 39.7,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "mirror-eyes.asset.perception.script.10",
      "samples": 139200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
